To begin with, the components test case does not need to be tested in the nuxt layer.
The `mountSuspended` contains options of `@vue/test-utils`.
So you can test with the `globals.plugins` options provided by `@vue/test-utils` as follows

```ts
// ... 
import { createI18n } from 'vue-i18n'

