Can you try to add this to your nuxt.config.ts ?

```ts
nitro: {
  prerender: {
    concurrency: 1,
 },
},
```

Here's a workaround for anyone having the same issue:

```
const refreshKey = ref(0);
watch(
  () => locale.value,
  (newLocale, oldLocale) => {
    console.log("Language switched from:", oldLocale, "to:", newLocale);
    // Refresh on nextTick to ensure DOM has updated
    nextTick(() => {
      console.log("Refreshing components due to language change");
      refreshKey.value++;
    });
  },
  { immediate: true }
);
```

Make sure you key your parent component with refreshKey

