It seems that Safari doesn’t show swipe-back snapshots when `window.history.scrollRestoration` is set to `manual`: https://github.com/vercel/next.js/issues/62133#issuecomment-2081826090

https://github.com/nuxt/nuxt/blob/850a879d3607dbde7fc321ca067db55a536d7ae1/packages/nuxt/src/pages/runtime/plugins/router.ts#L79

I haven't found an easy way to override it, but this simple workaround seems to be working (at least in my app):

```ts
// plugins/safari-scroll-restoration.client.ts

export default defineNuxtPlugin((nuxtApp) => {
  const { isSafari } = useDevice(); // from @nuxtjs/device package

  if (!isSafari) {
    return;
  }

  useRouter().afterEach(() => (window.history.scrollRestoration = "auto"));
});
