You can use [this](https://www.npmjs.com/package/remove-attr) npm package using vite.
An example configuration would be like:
```ts
import removeAttr from "remove-attr";

export default defineNuxtConfig({
  vite: {
    plugins: [
      removeAttr({
        extensions: ["vue"],
        attributes: ["data-test"],
      }),
    ],
  },
});
```

Or, if you want to be able to turn on/off the fact of removing `data-test` attributes:
```ts
import removeAttr from "remove-attr";

export default defineNuxtConfig({
  vite: {
    plugins: [
      removeAttr({
        extensions: ["vue"],
        attributes: [process.env.KEEP_DATA_TEST_ATTRIBUTES === "true" ? "data-nothing" : "data-test"],
      }),
    ],
  },
});
```

